.git
.gitignore
__pycache__
*.py[cod]
*.log
*.sqlite3
staticfiles
env
.env
# Every shape of it, not the exact name: the image built on 2026-09-06 held
# .env.bak-20260803, .env.prod.bak-20260803 and .env.prod.UNUSED-see-env-file,
# because `.env` matches one file and somebody's backup is called something
# else. A secret does not stop being one when it is renamed.
.env.*
*.env
# Credentials for the other service sharing that box.
*.htpasswd
# Hand-made backups of configuration, which are somebody's working copies and
# have no business in an image.
*.bak-*
# Agent transcripts, critiques and proposals: data, kept out of the repository
# on purpose, and no more part of the image than of it.
agents/runs
agents/critiques
agents/lessons
agents/table-ideas/BATCH-*.md
agents/table-ideas/SKIPPED.md
agents/campaign.stop
venv
.venv
node_modules
*.egg-info
dist
build
data_pipeline/oeis-data
__pycache__
